#X text 82 4154 governor (0): when 1 \, the object ends the oldest released note early whenever a block takes longer to compute than it lasts. Held notes are never ended. Meant for small machines such as Bela., f 64;
#X obj 60 4232 cnv 10 10 10 empty empty Partial\ parameters:\ u1\ u2\ l1\ l2 24 6 0 14 #1e3791 #000000 0;
#X text 82 4260 coarse 0..72: pitch in semitones \, 0 is C1 \; fine -50..50: fine tune \; keyfollow 0..16: pitch keyfollow step \, 11 is a semitone per \;   key \; lfomode 0..3: pitch LFO: off \, + \, - \, aftertouch and lever \; penvmode 0..2: pitch envelope: off \, + \, - \; bendmode 0..2: bender: off \, keyfollow \, normal \; wave 0..1: synth waveform: square \, sawtooth \; pcm 1..100: PCM sample \; pw 0..100: pulse width \; pwvelo -7..7: pulse width by velocity \; pwlfo 0..5: pulse width LFO: +1 \, -1 \, +2 \, -2 \, +3 \, -3 \; pwlfodepth 0..100: pulse width LFO depth \; pwat -7..7: pulse width by aftertouch \; cutoff 0..100: filter cutoff \; reso 0..30: filter resonance \; tvfkf 0..14: cutoff keyfollow step \; tvfbiaspoint 0..127: cutoff bias point and direction \; tvfbiaslevel -7..7: cutoff bias level \; tvfenv 0..100: filter envelope depth \; tvfvelo 0..100: filter envelope depth by velocity \; tvfdepthkf 0..4: filter envelope depth keyfollow \; tvftimekf 0..4: filter envelope time keyfollow \; tvft1 to tvft5 0..100: filter envelope times \; tvfl1 to tvfl3 0..100: filter envelope levels \; tvfsustain 0..100: filter envelope sustain level \; tvfend 0..1: filter envelope end level: 0 \, 100 \; tvflfo 0..5: filter LFO \, as pwlfo \; tvflfodepth 0..100: filter LFO depth \; tvfat -7..7: cutoff by aftertouch \; level 0..100: level of the partial \; velo -50..50: level by velocity \; tvabiaspoint 0..127: level bias point and direction \; tvabiaslevel -12..0: level bias level \; tvat1 to tvat5 0..100: level envelope times \; tval1 to tval3 0..100: level envelope levels \; tvasustain 0..100: level envelope sustain level \; tvaend 0..1: level envelope end level: 0 \, 100 \; tvavelofollow 0..4: level envelope time 1 by velocity \; tvatimekf 0..4: level envelope time keyfollow \; tvalfo 0..5: level LFO \, as pwlfo \; tvalfodepth 0..100: level LFO depth \; tvaat -7..7: level by aftertouch, f 64;
#X obj 60 4962 cnv 10 10 10 empty empty Tone\ parameters:\ upper\ lower 24 6 0 14 #1e3791 #000000 0;
#X text 82 4990 structure 1..7: S+S \, S+S ring \, P+S \, P+S ring \, S+P ring \, P+P \, \;   P+P ring \; penvvelo 0..2: pitch envelope by velocity \; penvtimekf 0..4: pitch envelope time keyfollow \; penvt1 to penvt4 0..50: pitch envelope times \; penvl0 to penvl2 -50..50: pitch envelope levels \; penvsustain -50..50: pitch envelope sustain level \; penvend -50..50: pitch envelope end level \; pmodlfo 0..100: pitch LFO depth \; pmodlever 0..100: pitch LFO depth by the lever \; pmodat 0..100: pitch LFO depth by aftertouch \; lfo1wave 0..3: triangle \, sawtooth \, square \, random \; lfo1rate 0..100: LFO 1 rate \; lfo1delay 0..100: LFO 1 delay \; lfo1sync 0..2: off \, on \, key \; lfo2wave 0..3: as lfo1wave \; lfo2rate 0..100: LFO 2 rate \; lfo2delay 0..100: LFO 2 delay \; lfo2sync 0..1: off \, on \; lfo3wave 0..3: as lfo1wave \; lfo3rate 0..100: LFO 3 rate \; lfo3delay 0..100: LFO 3 delay \; lfo3sync 0..1: off \, on \; eqlowfreq 0..15: low shelf frequency step \; eqlowgain -12..12: low shelf gain in dB \; eqhighfreq 0..21: high band frequency step \; eqhighq 0..8: high band width step \; eqhighgain -12..12: high band gain in dB \; chorustype 1..8: chorus type \; chorusrate 0..100: chorus rate \; chorusdepth 0..100: chorus depth \; chorus 0..100: chorus balance \; mute 0..3: partials sounding: none \, first \, second \, both \; balance 0..100: balance of the two partials, f 64;
#X obj 60 5548 cnv 10 10 10 empty empty Patch\ parameters:\ patch 24 6 0 14 #1e3791 #000000 0;
#X text 82 5576 keymode 0..8: whole \, dual \, split \, whole solo \, dual solo \, split \;   upper solo \, split lower solo \, separate \, separate solo \; split 0..60: split point \, 0 is C2 \; portamode 0..2: portamento on upper \, lower \, both \; ukeyshift to lkeyshift -24..24: key shift of each tone in \;   semitones \; ufine to lfine -50..50: fine tune of each tone \; bendrange 0..12: bender range in semitones \; atbend -12..12: pitch bend by aftertouch in semitones \; portatime 0..100: portamento time \; outmode 1..4: how the tones go to reverb and outputs \; reverbtype 1..32: reverb type \; reverb 0..100: reverb balance \; volume 0..100: level of the patch \, the volume message is the \;   master \; balance 0..100: balance of the two tones \; porta 0..1: portamento switch, f 64;
